<title>ARMENIA: SOCCER-GERMANY BEAT ARMENIA 5-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMANY BEAT ARMENIA 5-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>YEREVAN, Armenia 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany beat Armenia 5-1</p>
<p>(halftime 3-0) in a European Group Nine World Cup qualifier on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Armenia - Mikaelyan (85th minute)</p>
<p>Germany - Haessler (20th, 39th), Klinsmann (26th), Bobic</p>
<p>(69th), Kuntz (80th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000</p>
<p>Group nine standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Ukraine		 2   2   0   0   3   1   6</p>
<p> Portugal		3   1   1   1   4   2   4</p>
<p> Germany		 1   1   0   0   5   1   3</p>
<p> Armenia		 3   0   2   1   2   6   2</p>
<p> Northern Ireland    2   0   1   1   1   2   1</p>
<p> Albania		 1   0   0   1   0   3   0</p>
<p>Next matches: Nov 9 Germany v Northern Ireland, Portugal v</p>
<p>Ukraine, Albania v Armenia</p>
</text>
